                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="testi-item">
                    <div class="author-desc">
                        <div class="desc"><img class="quote" src="/assets/images/testimonial/style5/quote2.png" alt="">I peronally use this app. its very good one. anyone who wants to get prepared for One Paper MCQ, will find this app much usefull . thanks</div>

                    </div>
                    <div class="author-part">
                        <a class="name" href="#">Abid Manzoor</a>
                        <span class="designation">Student</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="testi-item">
                    <div class="author-desc">
                        <div class="desc">
                            <img class="quote" src="/assets/images/testimonial/style5/quote2.png" alt="">It's a good application for preparing ppsc exams Give good approach to learn. Very useful app. Recomended!!!
                        </div>
    
                    </div>
                    <div class="author-part">
                        <a class="name" href="#">Sana Zubair</a>
                        <span class="designation">English Teacher</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="testi-item">
                    <div class="author-desc">
                        <div class="desc"><img class="quote" src="/assets/images/testimonial/style5/quote2.png" alt="">Damn good and informative. It is too much useful and also the explanation includes for further guide to know more about.</div>

                    </div>
                    <div class="author-part">
                        <a class="name" href="#">Kulsoom Baloch</a>
                        <span class="designation">Student</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="testi-item">
                    <div class="author-desc">
                        <div class="desc"><img class="quote" src="/assets/images/testimonial/style5/quote2.png" alt="">Excellent app,but it should work offline .The subject of journalism should also be include.</div>

                    </div>
                    <div class="author-part">
                        <a class="name" href="#">Umar Farooq</a>
                        <span class="designation">Teacher</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="testi-item">
                    <div class="author-desc">
                        <div class="desc"><img class="quote" src="/assets/images/testimonial/style5/quote2.png" alt="">Very good experience Very helpful for knowledge and test preparation Content is divided categories and in parts.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="author-part">
                        <a class="name" href="#">Somana Ashiq</a>
                        <span class="designation">Math Teacher</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Testimonial Section End -->
    <!-- Section bg Wrap 2 start -->

    <!-- Section bg Wrap 2 End -->
</div>
<!-- Main content End -->